7. CUPPING SUITE
================================================================================

The Cupping Suite is accessed by swiping left past the final supply chain stage.
It provides tools for conducting cupping protocols and comparing scores.
Follows SCA-style cupping protocol.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
7.1 Entry and Exit
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ENTRY
- Swipe left from final supply chain stage (typically Roasting or Retail)
- Transition animation: current view recedes, cupping interface slides in
- Visual cue: blob transforms from circle to square (structured data context)

EXIT
- Swipe right returns to supply chain timeline
- Swipe up accesses inventory (same as elsewhere)
- Blob returns to circular form on exit

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
7.2 Cupping Protocol Interface
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

PROTOCOL SELECTION
- SCA standard cupping form (default)
- Simplified scoring (optional)
- Custom protocols (user-defined, future feature)

ATTRIBUTE SCORING
Each attribute scored on 0-10 scale via slider or tap increment:

  Attributes (SCA Standard)
  ----------------------------------------
  Fragrance/Aroma
  Flavor
  Aftertaste
  Acidity
  Body
  Balance
  Uniformity
  Clean Cup
  Sweetness
  Overall
  ----------------------------------------

INTERFACE BEHAVIOR
- One attribute per screen (maintains single-feature principle)
- Swipe left/right to navigate between attributes
- Blob size/deformation reflects current score for attribute
- Final screen: summary with total score

SCORE ENTRY
- Tap blob to increment by 0.25
- Hold blob to decrement
- Alternative: horizontal slider below blob

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
7.3 Score Comparison
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

After completing personal cupping, user can compare:

COMPARISON VIEWS
- Personal score vs. official lot score
- Personal score vs. other users' scores (if connected)
- Same lot, different roast profiles
- Historical scores over time

VISUAL TREATMENT
- Split view: multiple blobs side by side
- Size differential represents score differential
- Tap any blob to see detailed breakdown

