--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
9.6 Accessibility Considerations
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MOTION SENSITIVITY
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion media query
- Provide toggle in settings to disable animations
- Reduced motion mode: instant transitions, no wobble

SCREEN READER SUPPORT
- All interactive elements have aria-labels
- Swipe alternatives: button controls for navigation
- Announce page transitions and data changes

CONTRAST
- Black on white exceeds WCAG AAA (21:1 ratio)
- Ensure gray tones maintain minimum 4.5:1 for text
- Visibility score opacity must not reduce text contrast below threshold

TOUCH TARGETS
- Minimum 44x44px for all interactive elements
- Adequate spacing between targets (minimum 8px)

