- How should lots with zero visibility score appear? Invisible? Dotted outline?
- Should there be sound design? (Squishy sounds on interaction?)

DATA
- Who can add stages to a lot? Only participants? Any user?
- How is verification performed? Manual review? Automated checks?
- What happens when participants report conflicting data?

BUSINESS
- Is there a freemium model? What features are gated?
- How do producers/farmers onboard? Mobile app? SMS?
- What's the revenue model for sustainability?

TECHNICAL
- Native app priority? PWA sufficient for MVP?
- Offline support requirements? (Important for farm-level data entry)
- Integration with existing systems (trading platforms, ERP)?

NETWORK/GLOBAL VIEW
- What relationship types matter most to users?
- How far back in supply chain should connections trace?
- Should similarity be computed (cupping profiles) or only explicit relationships?

